        {
          "segment_id": "summary",
          "type": "summary",
          "source_text": "The father remembers that his school had no security guards when he was a child and students could come and go as they pleased.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-01-we-could-come-and-go-freely_summary_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:42:41+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ktkP7Nsj67dw2zcplQYt",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          }
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Our school had walls, but the gates were always open. You could leave whenever you wanted!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-01-we-could-come-and-go-freely_dialogue_001_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:42:42+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "What about security guards?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-01-we-could-come-and-go-freely_dialogue_002_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:42:44+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "There weren't any. Who had security guards back then? Nobody ever saw one at an elementary school!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-01-we-could-come-and-go-freely_dialogue_003_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:42:45+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "When we were a little older, in what was called upper primary, we could still leave whenever we wanted because the toilets were outside the school grounds.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-01-we-could-come-and-go-freely_dialogue_004_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:42:48+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "note:004",
          "type": "note",
          "source_text": "\"Upper primary\" referred to grades four and five, the upper grades in the five-year elementary school system used at the time.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-01-we-could-come-and-go-freely_note_004_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:42:50+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ktkP7Nsj67dw2zcplQYt",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "004"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Did thieves ever come in?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-01-we-could-come-and-go-freely_dialogue_005_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:42:51+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "What thieves? There weren't any!",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-01-we-could-come-and-go-freely_dialogue_006_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:42:53+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "It's not like your school now. The whole place is tightly fenced in, and once you're inside, you aren't allowed to leave.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-01-we-could-come-and-go-freely_dialogue_007_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:42:54+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
